{"4253020": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Murder Meet Cute", "steam_appid": 4253020, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4867250], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253020/extras/b2eb21ed10b854734fda8c91e9bf42d1.avif?t=1788259323\" width=1445 height=137 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Amy 'wiz kid' Bailey, I don't mind fixing computers, but customers are such a drag. I guess sometimes there’s cute guys to keep things interesting, like this guy from yesterday? Kinda cringy, but cute - and his COMPUTER. I don’t know why those files are broken like that, but something freaky's going on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253020/extras/79cf6b8177f95d2a30f29a0ff30fbcc0.poster.avif?t=1788259323\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253020/extras/79cf6b8177f95d2a30f29a0ff30fbcc0.webm?t=1788259323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253020/extras/79cf6b8177f95d2a30f29a0ff30fbcc0.mp4?t=1788259323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What, did you think the night shift avoided customers? Hell outta luck girl, turns out people throw their machines out windows at all hours of the day and night. Don’t worry, I know how to handle these losers, some of them are even ok.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253020/extras/65d1efdedd8c8602d537fb87fb705b19.poster.avif?t=1788259323\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253020/extras/65d1efdedd8c8602d537fb87fb705b19.webm?t=1788259323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253020/extras/65d1efdedd8c8602d537fb87fb705b19.mp4?t=1788259323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ok, when I say I’m a genius, I <strong>mean</strong> I’m a <i>genius</i> when it comes to computers. Boot that boy into DOS and there isn’t anything I can’t fix, especially<i> </i>with that new tech. And if I just happen to take a small memento after I do my job… who’s to know?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253020/extras/ab817bbf5b0a40642aa393a6d6eb62d7.poster.avif?t=1788259323\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253020/extras/ab817bbf5b0a40642aa393a6d6eb62d7.webm?t=1788259323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253020/extras/ab817bbf5b0a40642aa393a6d6eb62d7.mp4?t=1788259323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I have the most up to date gear at home, but mostly I just chat with friends on Jabber and do my <strong>fav </strong>thing to unwind before work; mess with people on that stupid conspiracy forum Jen loves so much. It’s almost too easy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253020/extras/5f5419a69376c375c5b7d7bc1d052d3a.poster.avif?t=1788259323\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253020/extras/5f5419a69376c375c5b7d7bc1d052d3a.webm?t=1788259323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253020/extras/5f5419a69376c375c5b7d7bc1d052d3a.mp4?t=1788259323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wait, excuse me, what??? That wasn’t in my job description?? Marcus what the FU-!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Feature List</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relive the cultural touchstones <strong>of the 90s</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>power fantasy roleplay</strong> of a <strong>badass goth</strong> telling <br>customers where to shove it</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore multiple <strong>retro OS</strong> systems including windows 95 and DOS - <strong>ICQ, emails, forums</strong> and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glimpse into peoples <strong>hidden lives</strong> via their PCs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Art direction inspired by <strong>90s FMV games</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover a <strong>murder conspiracy</strong> through clients machines</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253020/extras/da601ada724736ea5f03630c001d48f0.avif?t=1788259323\" width=750 height=579 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253020/extras/b2eb21ed10b854734fda8c91e9bf42d1.avif?t=1788259323\" width=1445 height=137 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph